#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:33
#: 5e5f4174c3a84030ae2941b574c5937f
msgid ""
"Most hardware `<param>` values do **not** appear on `ros2 param list` — "
"they are baked into `/robot_description` when xacro runs. Some public "
"hardware interface plugins also `declare_parameter` the same names as "
"node params (ARX, HighTorque, Marvin, some 灵巧手); those rows are marked "
"**Runtime** on the matching driver page — [Hardware "
"Interfaces](../../4-reference/hardware/0-index.md). Confirm the plugin "
"with `ros2 control list_hardware_interfaces` and the xacro under "
"`xacro/ros2_control/`."
msgstr ""
"多数驱动层 `<param>` **不会**出现在 `ros2 param list` 上 — xacro 运行时已写入 "
"`/robot_description`。部分公开驱动层插件也会把同名项 `declare_parameter` "
"成节点参数（ARX、HighTorque、Marvin、部分灵巧手）；这些行在对应驱动页标为 **运行时** — "
"[驱动层](../../4-reference/hardware/0-index.md)。用 `ros2 control "
"list_hardware_interfaces` 和 `xacro/ros2_control/` 下的 xacro 确认插件。"

