msgid ""
"**Basic Joint Controller** and **OCS2 Arm Controller** both use the same "
"ros2_control `ControllerInterface` / `controller_manager` keys. They are "
"listed **once** here. Per-controller tables keep package-specific keys "
"only."
msgstr ""
"**Basic Joint Controller** 与 **OCS2 Arm Controller** 共用同一套 ros2_control "
"`ControllerInterface` / `controller_manager` 键。此处**只列一次**。各控制器表只保留包专有键。"

