#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:66
#: 38d611fc15a544ffa8f196e9163879fc
msgid ""
"One place for behavior that several controllers share in "
"`libraries/arms_controller_common/`. MoveJ YAML keys are on the [Basic "
"Joint Controller](../../4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md) "
"parameter table (the primary MoveJ page). **OCS2 Arm Controller** README "
"FSM is HOME / HOLD / OCS2; it constructs `StateMoveJ` for canonical "
"command `4` (and IK MoveL when `lina_planning` is present) but does not "
"treat MoveJ as a README first-class mode."
msgstr ""
"若干控制器在 `libraries/arms_controller_common/` 中共用的行为集中写在这里。MoveJ YAML 键写在 "
"[Basic Joint "
"Controller](../../4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md) 参数表（MoveJ"
" 主页）。**OCS2 Arm Controller** README 的 FSM 是 HOME / HOLD / OCS2；源码会为规范命令 "
"`4` 构造 `StateMoveJ`（有 `lina_planning` 时还有 IK MoveL），但 README 不把 MoveJ "
"当作一等模式。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:68
